And it should record evolutions

Some patterns are special cases of others:

P_a\subset P_b

Some compose:

P_a+P_b\rightarrow P_c

Some are the same horse:

P_a\sim P_b

Some are opposites:

P_a\leftrightarrow P_b

Some evolve after enough evidence:

P_a\xrightarrow{\Delta}P_a'

So the Pokédex metaphor becomes surprisingly apt.

Not because we’re collecting cute names.

Because we’re discovering families, types, transformations, habitats, counters, synergies, and evolutions.

